  "full_text": "So, what is this? Beatty Day or something? Yeah? Is there going to be a parade or something? Uh, there should be one about 10 o'clock. Okay, I guess I'll see it when I see it, huh? Ha ha ha. So, there's a lot of miners here? Like, like old Clement, or what's it? Oh my darling, oh my darling. No? Ha ha ha. You don't sing songs like that anymore? No. You gotta make some new ones. You gotta make some new songs. You guys gotta, like, play music, you know? They had a live band there the other day, and I was thinking of, like, starting a band. I play drums. Yeah, like, I gotta, like, build a band or something, you know? Yeah, didn't bother to learn it, huh? You didn't pick up a guitar or anything? You should do that. Go pick up a guitar, just strum out a few notes, and then start making up songs, you know? You gotta make up your own songs anyway",
